# SELECT and OCT- / OCT+ (the user, 2026-10-28). SELECT never pages: on a layer's pages (its main, sound, Repeats,
# Pattern and Move pages) it is that layer's level, 1 a detent, with the level ring and said ("SEQ 38"); elsewhere
# nothing (no tempo, not with HOME held either; PERFORM stays). OCT- / OCT+ on the
# Sequence's, the Lead's and Sequence 2's pages: its octave, a step a press (on its release; none held on, none with
# both), said ("SEQ OCTAVE -2"); lit while that octave is above (OCT+) or below (OCT-) where the piece was loaded.
# The Drone's and the Atmosphere's pages, and pages of no layer: nothing
wait 300
listen
# Skellig: the Sequence at 44 (AISLING: its levels 3 dB under the first flutes-and-harps balance), the tempo 76
tap ARP
wait 300
expect view 2
expect par1 44
spin SELECT -6
wait 200
expect par1 38
expect view 2
expect octring 2
said SEQ 38
# its sound page too (the same layer)
tap ARP
wait 300
expect view 9
spin SELECT 1
wait 200
expect par1 39
expect view 9
# Sequence 2's Pattern page: Sequence 2's level (0, Skellig's off: brought in, quietly)
tap SEQ
wait 200
tap SEQ
wait 200
tap SEQ
wait 300
expect view 16
spin SELECT 2
wait 200
expect par3 2
expect view 16
# the Atmosphere (SAVE): its level, Atmosphere (Surf 5 in Skellig)
tap SAVE
wait 300
expect par29 5
spin SELECT -1
wait 200
expect par29 4
# (the user: one knob, one job) elsewhere SELECT does nothing to the tempo or a level: the Aisling page (Energy
# now: homesel.amb) and the Key page (no tempo), HOME held (no tempo any more), Space, PERFORM (it stays)
tap HOME
wait 300
expect view 0
spin SELECT 4
wait 200
expect view 0
expect par18 76
tap HOME
wait 300
expect view 18
spin SELECT -2
wait 200
expect view 18
expect par18 76
press HOME
wait 100
spin SELECT 3
wait 200
release HOME
wait 300
expect par18 76
tap FX
wait 300
expect view 5
spin SELECT 3
wait 200
expect view 5
tap SEL
wait 300
expect view 17
spin SELECT 1
wait 300
expect view 17
expect par18 76
expect par1 39
expect par3 2
expect par29 4
expect par0 38
expect par2 76
tap HOME
wait 300
# OCT- / OCT+: Samhain (the Sequence at -1, Sequence 2 at -1, its default, the Lead
# at -1)
turn PRESET 5
wait 500
expect piece 5
tap ARP
wait 300
expect view 2
expect par21 -1
expect litbtn12 0
expect litbtn13 0
tap OCT-
wait 200
expect par21 -2
said SEQ OCTAVE -2
expect litbtn12 1
expect litbtn13 0
expect par1 59
tap OCT-
wait 200
expect par21 -2
tap OCT+
wait 200
expect par21 -1
expect litbtn12 0
expect litbtn13 0
tap OCT+
wait 200
expect par21 0
expect litbtn13 1
said SEQ OCTAVE 0
tap OCT+
wait 200
tap OCT+
wait 200
expect par21 2
# held on: one step, on its release (no repeat)
tap OCT-
wait 200
press OCT-
wait 1500
expect par21 1
release OCT-
wait 200
expect par21 0
# both together: nothing (no mute any more, no step)
press OCT-
wait 50
press OCT+
wait 200
release OCT-
release OCT+
wait 300
expect par21 0
expect mutes 0
# the Lead (LFO): -2 .. 1 (Samhain's low, at -1)
tap LFO
wait 300
expect view 3
expect par44 -1
tap OCT+
wait 200
expect par44 0
said LEAD OCTAVE 0
expect litbtn13 1
tap OCT+
wait 200
expect par44 1
tap OCT+
wait 200
expect par44 1
# Sequence 2 (SEQ): -2 .. 1
tap SEQ
wait 300
expect view 4
tap OCT-
wait 200
expect par23 -2
said SEQ 2 OCTAVE -2
expect litbtn12 1
expect litbtn13 0
# (the lights are that layer's: the Drone's page shows none, and OCT does nothing there)
tap ENV
wait 300
expect view 1
expect litbtn12 0
expect litbtn13 0
tap OCT+
wait 200
tap OCT-
wait 200
expect par21 0
expect par44 1
expect par23 -2
expect par0 42
expect octring 0
